{"id":"66383f6d581fc040dc4deae771a172a18e1b5c94","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1257610","title":"claude 被封了，codex 写代码能力还有些欠缺，有没有其他在写代码这块的平替品","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"nunterr","excerpt":"程序员 - @nunterr -","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"topic-replies\">\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/代码\"><li></li> 代码</a><a href=\"/tag/平替\"><li></li> 平替</a><a href=\"/tag/模型\"><li></li> 模型</a></P><p><span>28 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-11-18 02:35:08 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18297540\" data-reply-id=\"18297540\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fffe1f0e50a9db5b001e68a2cda01dda?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ltfree\" data-uid=\"495390\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>1</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>中转站的 claude，不然就没有了，不过我对中转站很抵触，codex 写代码还好，一直在用。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18297543\" data-reply-id=\"18297543\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1dab/7d7f/254813_normal.png?m=1793601604\" alt=\"fe619742721\" data-uid=\"254813\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>2</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>gemini 这波新模型感觉挺好的，我用次级模型写代码感觉都比 codex 舒服</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18297579\" data-reply-id=\"18297579\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f1587c764c2ba142b1955f4ac9968df5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nunterr\" data-uid=\"505801\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>4</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/ltfree\">ltfree</a> 中转在缓存和实际使用的模型都有一定量的掺水，<br>中转是转的订阅 claude20 刀能跑 2000-3000 刀额度，就这样他们还会掺水其他模型</p><p>用惯了 claude 再用 codex 在写代码和理解能力上都有一些差距，而且 codex 的额度消耗还很快，周额度，在轻度使用的情况下最多坚持 3 天，重度都坚持不了一天</p></div>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18297637\" data-reply-id=\"18297637\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/155abc1b4de08abdb2140109c711b1de?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kimiarchangell\" data-uid=\"463514\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>5</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>不明白你们有多高的需求还是特殊场景，我觉得 astra 用的很舒服，而且讨论方案沟通能力甚至比 opus 好一点</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18297682\" data-reply-id=\"18297682\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/fffe1f0e50a9db5b001e68a2cda01dda?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ltfree\" data-uid=\"495390\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>6</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>@<a href=\"/member/nunterr\">nunterr</a> 掺水是肯定的，所以不去用，codex 我的是 20x 的，目前是两个人使用，目前 6.1sol 随意使用。<br>至于你说的和 claude 差距，我还没用过 claude，等有机会再体验吧哈哈，主要是封号太难了</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18297853\" data-reply-id=\"18297853\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f1587c764c2ba142b1955f4ac9968df5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nunterr\" data-uid=\"505801\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>7</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>@<a href=\"/member/kimiarchangell\">kimiarchangell</a> 我最多用 SOL 高，轻度用两三天额度就没了，astra 都不敢用，写个代码半天就能把周额度用完，claude opus 5.5 是真能抗用一周</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18298184\" data-reply-id=\"18298184\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a4249e407b17a518d467a1e17cf22cfd?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zuosiruan\" data-uid=\"204104\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>8</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>觉得 codex 写代码能力还有欠缺的话那没有任何替代的了</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18298207\" data-reply-id=\"18298207\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0fba4a46ed60d9a76fb3fc7e52ca9197?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"gybin02\" data-uid=\"232525\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>9</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>我没买过任何订阅，现在就是免费版混着用：平时写代码先扔给 Gemini，真正卡住的调试才上 Muse，周额度基本够用。楼主先别急着续贵的，把活按难易分分级，免费组合顶一阵再说。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18298250\" data-reply-id=\"18298250\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0fba4a46ed60d9a76fb3fc7e52ca9197?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"gybin02\" data-uid=\"232525\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>11</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>@<a href=\"/member/gybin02\">gybin02</a> 主力还是 Kiro 里面的 claude，其他的 Gemini，muse 只是不够替代的</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18298279\" data-reply-id=\"18298279\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f1587c764c2ba142b1955f4ac9968df5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nunterr\" data-uid=\"505801\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>12</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>@<a href=\"/member/deplives\">deplives</a> plus 会员吧，如果正常放开用，周限制最多不会超过一天半就能用完，省着用最多三天，我现在用 GPT 6 sol 高，昨天用了几次后，现在还剩 19%，已经放着了，😂</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18298342\" data-reply-id=\"18298342\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e3fa/0129/221625_normal.png?m=1595731333\" alt=\"zhuyw2006\" data-uid=\"221625\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>13</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>我也是刚换 codex pro，astra max 我感觉还能接受。复杂的任务要做好测试，在多审视。最终效果不好比 Claude 差。Claude 封号太折腾了</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18298419\" data-reply-id=\"18298419\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e8330d6ff096bc9361aac23009cd86b5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Riesz\" data-uid=\"555215\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>15</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>没用过 claude，但是 claude 前端的确一眼比 gpt 强太多。希望 6.2 能改进吧。<br>后端，gpt 还是可以的，防御性编程，也是后端需要的。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18298527\" data-reply-id=\"18298527\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/721ac1354ab27a00d16947f5b8fc4e47?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zed1018\" data-uid=\"315288\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>16</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>@<a href=\"/member/Riesz\">Riesz</a> 确实，我一开始挺烦 gpt 给我写的一堆 tests 的。直到： <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vp0zMRT.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vp0zMRT.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/4RymWfQ.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4RymWfQ.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18298730\" data-reply-id=\"18298730\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/02c2/7682/7318_normal.png?m=1781252794\" alt=\"chengxiao\" data-uid=\"7318\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>17</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>astra 开 ultra 还可以的,有人说 astra 不耐用,但是这 openai 一个月送 2-3 张重置卡,基本也够用了</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18298755\" data-reply-id=\"18298755\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f7514cbdee88f0e3a41f0cce6bfa27ce?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"fdong26\" data-uid=\"709850\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>18</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>@<a href=\"/member/kimiarchangell\">kimiarchangell</a> 首先最关键最影响体验的就是太慢了，然后就是 astra 写的代码我基本上看不懂，而且很容易过度防御，这样不知道代码里有没有埋什么坑，opus 在这些问题上就会好很多，速度快且订阅价格便宜，20 刀套餐足够我日常使用，而 gpt 起码要 100 刀套餐才够我用</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18298970\" data-reply-id=\"18298970\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/edca/a4e2/453316_normal.png?m=1748186088\" alt=\"so2back\" data-uid=\"453316\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>19</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>一直用的 6.1sol max 写代码感觉还可以呀，用 astra 就耗不起了，好像也没其他可以比得过 claude codex 的了</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18299144\" data-reply-id=\"18299144\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/05b6/da4a/595510_normal.png?m=1728392310\" alt=\"WizardLeo\" data-uid=\"595510\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>22</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>@<a href=\"/member/deplives\">deplives</a> plus 就不是给正经开发用的，目标大概是给计算机专业本科生这个级别的用户，做做一个对话写几个函数几十行代码这个级别的需求。顺带第一时间体验两下新模型，其他时候覆盖日常使用写文案问日常问题的水平。</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18299427\" data-reply-id=\"18299427\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0bab3cf136e861c6711480948bad5ffe?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Yuanlaoer\" data-uid=\"638857\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>26</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>号被封一周了。一直在折腾 codex，到现在还是经常添乱。<br>哎，ta 不一样……</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18300601\" data-reply-id=\"18300601\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5c78416e89d4db967b8bafece9bf809a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"0xcode\" data-uid=\"555640\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n            <p><span>27</span></p>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            <p>@<a href=\"/member/nunterr\">nunterr</a> #7 确实 同价位 20 刀的 Claude pro 非常耐打  可惜我的也弹 kyc 了 也在寻找解决方案</p>\n            \n            \n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n    \n\n    <div id=\"r_18301046\" data-reply-id=\"18301046\">\n<table>\n    <tr>\n        <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/8618aab7f4ed261cc87c1e4a590bdfb3?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"loveleyla2013\" data-uid=\"470394\"></td>\n        <td></td>\n        <td>\n            <div>\n            \n           